        <item>
        <title>A Fantastic Journey to Altay</title>
        <link>https://www.despairjasper.com/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/</link>
        <pubDate>Wed, 03 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://www.despairjasper.com/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://www.despairjasper.com/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/cover.jpg" alt="Featured image of post A Fantastic Journey to Altay" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Perhaps the filters used for Lake Brienz in the K-drama were unnecessary,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;but Kanas in September,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;is a movie in itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check out our video footage:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;video controls width=&#34;100%&#34; preload=&#34;metadata&#34;&gt;
&lt;source src=&#34;https://www.despairjasper.com/videos/Kanas.mp4&#34; type=&#34;video/mp4&#34;&gt;
Your browser does not support the video tag.
&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A magical scene unfolded at the Diaoyutai (Fishing Pavilion). The weather wasn&amp;rsquo;t cooperating that morning; hail started falling the moment the shuttle bus dropped us off on the mountain. We bit the bullet and hiked up to the highest peak, and suddenly, the sky cleared up. We didn&amp;rsquo;t miss out on this beautiful piece of amber.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www.despairjasper.com/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery1.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1919&#34;
	height=&#34;1080&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://www.despairjasper.com/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery1_hu_656254628e2e62b3.jpg 480w, https://www.despairjasper.com/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery1_hu_b90509da35c6dea9.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Kanas Lake below Diaoyutai&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An equally magical moment happened at the Tuluke Rock Paintings, but it was really strange: why did this trail feel completely abandoned? We didn&amp;rsquo;t even notice the rock paintings, but this has got to be the absolute best viewing spot for Kanas Lake!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www.despairjasper.com/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery2.jpg&#34;
